# Unit <f4r.H1>: Labels on plant.
# "U" readings by J. Stolfi from BLI04.

# Writing on the stem, just above. Assuming they are voynichese glyphs
# are transcribed by reading sideways and upwards (SU). Assuming they
# are (badly misshaped) Roman letters, they are transcribed as comments
# <!R:...> by reading from top down (TB), with each letter upright.
# ??? Get other people's transcriptions.
# <f4r.H1.1;U>       <!SU>h.o.si<!R:TB:rot>

# On rightmost flower.
# A tiny but clear uppecase Roman "F".
# <f4r.H1.2;U>       <!R:F=>

