<f34r.7;U>          <:>qokedy.dal.chdy-<!®>olchy-<!®>ykchy-<!®><!\>ykedy.qokchdy.s.ar.oldam<|>
# &Cs; = a @C ligd to the top of an @s.  Maybe mfd @'sh'.
# &Cr; = a @C ligd to the top of an @r.  Maybe mfd @'sh'.
<f34r.8;U>         &Cr;otchy.qoky-<!®>olk-<!®>checkhy-<!®><!\>ys,air.air.chodar.tam<|>
<f34r.9;U>          <:>ykchdy.qod-<!®>ar-<!®>ch&CT;-<!®>aikhy-<!®><!\>or,lchey.todaly.okaiin.dardy<$>
# &o+f; = an @o glued (not ligd) to the leg of a NON-platf gallows @f.
<f34r.10;U>        tcheo.olchckhy.oly-<!®>otchdy.chefalar<|>
<f34r.11;U>         <:>qokeey.sh.kaldaiin-<!®>cheky.cthdaly-<!®>otchedy.chty.saiin<|>
