# [ONE-LEG GALLOWS CHECKED]

# Unit <f57v.X1>: Label outside the diagram.
# This unit consists of a single-word label at 10:30, just clockwise
# of the Northwest radial stroke across the outermost text ring.

# Single word at 10:30.
