# Unit <f75v.N2>: Labels above the lower pond.
# In some transcriptions, including the EVMT files, these labels were
# entered as part of lines <f75v.P3.24> through <f75v.P3.32>. These
# labels are delimited by a narrow channel on the left and separated
# by nymph heads "<!hd>" intruding from the pond below.
# Units <f75v.N2>, <f75v.N3>, and <f75v.P4> may constitute a sigle
# logical group of labels.

# Line 1, label 1.
# May be words 1 and 2 of <f75v.P3.24>.
# May be two separate labels.
<f75v.50;U>        <!channel>otal.opal<!hd><|>

# Line 1, label 2.
# May be words 3 and 4 of <f75v.P3.24>.
# May be two labels.
