# Line 2, label 1.
# May be word 1 of <f75v.P3.25>.
<f75v.53;U>        <!channel>ytedy<!pond><$>

# Unit <f75v.P3>: Text to the right of the lower pond.
# The following paragraph lies to the right of the "lower pond" with
# 19 women. There is extra text above, to the left of, and below the
# pond, shown here as <!->-comments, which may or may not be part of this
# paragraph; that material is transcribed as separate units,
# <f75v.N2>, <f75v.N3>, and <f75v.P4>.

# Words at the left of this line, between nymph heads,
# are entries <f75v.N2.1> through <f75v.N2.3>.
<f75v.60;U>        <!hd>kol.kedy.qokedy.qoky.lpchdy.qotchdy.lol<|>

