<f99r.1;U>         okaramog<$>

# Unit <f99r.L1>: Labels in row of plants 1 (top).
# There are 12 plants and 12 labels, not conunting the label on the
# container at left.
# This row of labeled plants is actually two sub-rows, "1a" and "1b".
# There are 9 labels and 9 roots in the top sub-row, alternating.
# There are 3 labels and 3 roots (one with leaf) in the bottom sub-row.
# ??? Split the sub-rows as separate units?

# Near top edge, West of plant <f99r>[1,1].
