<f99v.1;U>         okaramy<$>

# Unit <f99v.L1>: Labels in row of plants 1 (top).
# "W" alternative transcription by Rene Zandbergen from original.
# There appears to be eight labels on eight plants.
# Two of the labels are broken by intruding drawings.
