<f99v.3;U>         otar-<!®>chy<$>

# plant <f99v>[1,2] - light, S-shaped stem

# Between plants <f99v>[1,2] and <f99v>[1,3], neat top.
<f99v.4;U>         oldy<!®><$>

# plant <f99v>[1,3] - bulb with fingers

# Astride plant <f99v>[1,4], at base of stem.
